      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To construct a secure, internal tiered communication framework that maintains a minimal digital footprint, we will establish distinct levels of confidentiality and deniability. First, we'll start with a Core Tier, which involves a pre-shared physical codebook and signals for clandestine meetings outside of traditional channels. For digital communication, a secondary tier called the Silent Whisper network will employ vetted, ephemeral messaging apps with inbuilt strong encryption and auto-deletion features. Lastly, a Sentinel Tier will integrate steganographic techniques on low-traffic digital media (e.g., images or videos) to pass messages further. Each tier strictly adheres to need-to-know principles, reducing exposure and potential digital traces. Complete discretion and professional application are mandatory to ensure effectiveness and confidentiality among the inner circle.",
